        "Description": "Our client hired us to kill a group of poachers that mistook our clients dog for a rare animal they were hunting.  Information tells us that they are located in Chongqing, to meet with their buyers who wanted the rare meat, Luli He. The client has asked us to eliminate the poacher trio and their buyer Luli He, happy hunting 47.\r-Your good friend Doob",
